{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203200","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1320320001:1":{"text":"满满之前就想说了，这幅画的画框摔断了好几处！画布也不平整，看起来脏兮兮的。","source_cn":"满满之前就想说了，这幅画的画框摔断了好几处！画布也不平...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39566573C86CBAF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"残破的画作","source_cn":"残破的画作","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF773940056FD220C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320320002:1":{"text":"……满满，你再仔细看看。","source_cn":"……满满，你再仔细看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645301ADBAD5D950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320320003:1":{"text":"——画布早就被整理平整了，那些就是脏污呀！","source_cn":"——画布早就被整理平整了，那些就是脏污呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4624992E5B4BE7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320320004:0":{"text":"除了这些，最严重的是画面磨损。尤其是在被撕裂的裂口两边。","source_cn":"除了这些，最严重的是画面磨损。尤其是在被撕裂的裂口两边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86201EA840EBBD1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320320005:1